## Visual Studio standard .gitignore
## Based on https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/master/VisualStudio.gitignore

# ==============================================================================
# User-specific files (ユーザー設定ファイル)
# ==============================================================================
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.launch
*.vscode/

