compile_commands.json
build/
out/

# ==============================================================================
# File extensions to ignore (拡張子による除外 - 最も重要)
# ==============================================================================
# VS build output files
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.log
*.tlog
*.ipch
*.pch
*.res
*.idb
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.tmp
